<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f5f5f5;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      .header {
        background: #0b2343;
        padding: 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }
      .header p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        margin: 6px 0 0;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .body {
        padding: 30px;
      }
      .body p {
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .panel {
        background: #fafbfc;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 18px;
        margin: 18px 0;
      }
      .panel strong {
        color: #0b2343;
      }
      .reason {
        background: #fff7ed;
        border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 18px;
        margin: 18px 0;
        color: #7c2d12;
      }
      .footer {
        background: #fafbfc;
        padding: 18px 30px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 12px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Update on your ESOL teaching application</h1>
        <p>Amber Training</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p>Hi {{teacherName}},</p>

        <p>
          Thank you for applying to teach ESOL on the Amber Training platform.
          After reviewing your application we are not able to approve it at
          this time.
        </p>

        <div class="reason">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0;"><strong>Reason</strong></p>
          <p style="margin: 0;">{{reason}}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
            <strong>What you can do next</strong>
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">
            If the issue noted above can be resolved (for example, an updated
            DBS certificate, a copy of the original CELTA/DELTA certificate,
            or additional ESOL teaching evidence), you're welcome to update
            your application from your dashboard and we'll review it again.
          </p>
          <p style="margin: 0;">
            Your regular tutor account is unaffected — you can continue
            teaching on the open marketplace while you address this.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you have questions or believe this decision was made in error,
          please reply directly to this email.
        </p>

        <p>— The Amber Training team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        Amber Training Ltd · ambertraining.co.uk<br />
        &copy; {{currentYear}} Amber Training Ltd. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
